=09=09=09=09=09=09<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #202124; font-size=
: 18px;">Hi Konda Sree Vaibhav,</p>

=09=09=09=09=09=09<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #3c4043; font-size=
: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">It&#39;s <strong>3 September</strong>. That leav=
es exactly <strong>3 days</strong> to finish, test, and submit your project=
 before the Gen AI Ideathon portal locks.</p>
=09=09=09=09=09=09<!-- DEADLINE URGENCY CARD -->

=09=09=09=09=09=09<div style=3D"background-color: #fce8e6; border: 1px soli=
d #fad2cf; border-left: 5px solid #ea4335; border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; pa=
dding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
=09=09=09=09=09=09<p style=3D"margin: 0; color: #c5221f; font-size: 15px; f=
ont-weight: bold; line-height: 1.5;">=F0=9F=9A=A8 Submissions Close: 6 Sept=
ember, 11:59 PM IST</p>

=09=09=09=09=09=09<p style=3D"margin: 6px 0 0 0; color: #3c4043; font-size:=
 14px; line-height: 1.5;">72 hours is plenty of time to turn a working prot=
otype into a fully submitted entry&mdash;if you prioritize the core require=
ments today.</p>
=09=09=09=09=09=09</div>

=09=09=09=09=09=09<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 24px 0; color: #3c4043; font-size=
: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">Whether you&#39;re polishing your code or just r=
unning your first deployment on Cloud Run, here is your 3-day action checkl=
ist to cross the finish line:</p>
=09=09=09=09=09=09<!-- SECTION 1: WHAT YOU'RE BUILDING & EXTENDING -->

=09=09=09=09=09=09<div style=3D"background-color: #f8fafd; border: 1px soli=
d #c2e7ff; border-left: 5px solid #1a73e8; border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; pa=
dding: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
=09=09=09=09=09=09<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #041e49; font-size=
: 16px; font-weight: bold;">=F0=9F=92=A1 1. Core Build &amp; Key Extensions=
</p>

=09=09=09=09=09=09<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #3c4043; font-size=
: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">Your app must deploy on <strong>Cloud Run</stron=
g> with <strong>Firebase Auth</strong>, multi-turn <strong>Gemini API</stro=
ng> chats, <strong>Firestore</strong> data separation per user, and <strong=
>Secret Manager</strong> for API key security.</p>

=09=09=09=09=09=09<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #3c4043; font-size=
: 14px; line-height: 1.6;"><em>Remember:</em> Standout entries extend the c=
ore feature set! Add custom capabilities like Maps integration, Slack/Disco=
rd triggers, or personalized journal search analytics to score higher.</p>

=09=09=09=09=09=09<div style=3D"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px dash=
ed #1a73e8; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px;">
=09=09=09=09=09=09<p style=3D"margin: 0; color: #174ea6; font-size: 13px; l=
ine-height: 1.5;">=E2=9A=A1 <strong>Quick Tip:</strong> Use Custom Instruct=
ions in AI Studio to refine your app&#39;s code logic before adding new thi=
